<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">55块2 · 我的</view><view class="title">设置</view><view wx:if="{{config}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">计划参数</view><view class="list-row"><text>每日额度</text><text class="value">¥{{config.dailyBudget}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>日薪</text><text class="value">¥{{config.salaryPerDay / 100}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>计薪周期</text><text class="secondary-text">21日 — 20日</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>截止日</text><text class="secondary-text">{{config.deadline}}</text></view><view class="list-row"><text>最低目标</text><text class="value">¥{{config.goalMinimum}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">结算节奏</view><view class="list-row"><text>{{mode === 'daily' ? '每日结算' : '三天一结'}}</text><switch checked="{{mode === 'three-day'}}" color="#171717" bindchange="toggleMode" /></view><view class="caption">三天一结时，一次划入 ¥165.57，第 4 天再进行结算。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">预算情景</view><view class="scenario-grid"><button class="scenario {{config.scenario === '省' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-scenario="省" bindtap="selectScenario">省　¥48.29</button><button class="scenario {{config.scenario === '中' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-scenario="中" bindtap="selectScenario">中　¥55.19</button><button class="scenario {{config.scenario === '松' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-scenario="松" bindtap="selectScenario">松　¥63.73</button></view><view class="caption">切换后五期预算和储蓄轨迹会重新计算。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">金额校准</view><view class="caption">只记录差额，不覆盖原始流水。当前先校准工资卡。</view><input class="adjust-input" type="digit" placeholder="真实余额，例如 1200.00" value="{{realBalance}}" bindinput="inputReal" /><input class="adjust-input" type="digit" placeholder="账面余额，例如 1180.00" value="{{bookBalance}}" bindinput="inputBook" /><input class="adjust-input" placeholder="备注（可选）" value="{{adjustNote}}" bindinput="inputNote" /><button class="button" bindtap="saveAdjust">保存校准</button></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">数据与隐私</view><view class="caption">所有流水保存在本机，不使用云服务。</view><view class="list-row"><text>已记录支出</text><text class="value">{{expenseCount}} 笔</text></view><button class="button secondary" bindtap="exportCsv">复制 CSV 数据</button><button class="button secondary" bindtap="exportIcs">复制发薪日历 ICS</button><button class="button reset-button" bindtap="resetData">重置演示数据</button></view></view>
